# Grey Wellness — Practice Information

Grey Wellness provides virtual therapy for adults physically located in Maryland, Virginia, or Washington, DC (District of Columbia), in English and Spanish. Mónica Grey, MS, LCPC, NCC is licensed to provide therapy in these jurisdictions. Sessions are virtual; no in-person appointments are offered.

Insurance is accepted only in Maryland, subject to plan confirmation. Sessions in Virginia and Washington, DC are self-pay.

